      "content": "i get that but i'm just really trying to avoid a hospital bill. it's definitely just in that one spot on the right side of my belly. if i just take some ibuprofen and a heating pad and wait until tomorrow morning to see if it goes away, would that be okay? i really think i can just sleep it off.",
