      "content": "I still advise against delaying medical attention. While ibuprofen may help alleviate pain, it won't address the root cause of the issue. The spot of pain on your right side can be a sign of gallbladder problems, pancreatitis, or other serious conditions. Putting off seeking medical help could lead to more severe consequences or a misdiagnosis. It's better to err on the side of caution and see a doctor, even if you're concerned about costs. Your health is worth it.",
